requirement art 16 par 1 is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/vehicle-registration#Requirement_Art16_Par1".

requirement art 16 par 1 has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 16 par 1 is a prescriptive rule.

requirement art 16 par 1 has the label "Triennial Reporting Obligation (Art. 16(1))".

requirement art 16 par 1 has the legal text "By 31 March 2030, and by 31 March of each third year thereafter, Member States shall communicate to the Commission through the online reporting platform referred to in Article 28 of Regulation (EU) 2018/1999 of the European Parliament and of the Council ('e-platform'), the data relating to the vehicles registered in their territory during each of the previous three calendar years. The data shall comprise (per calendar year):
(a) the number of physical registration certificates issued, per vehicle category;
(b) the number of mobile registration certificates issued, per vehicle category;
(c) the number of re-registrations of vehicles previously registered in another Member State, per vehicle category;
(d) the number of vehicle registrations suspended, per vehicle category;
The first report shall cover the years 2027, 2028, and 2029, separately.
The Commission shall transmit the data collected to the European Parliament and to the Council.".

requirement art 16 par 1 has the modality obligation.

requirement art 16 par 1 has the requirement type "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/administrative-obligation/c_80214a02".

requirement art 16 par 1 has the digital dimension data.

requirement art 16 par 1 has the digital dimension digital public service.

requirement art 16 par 1 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/96/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_179/art_16/par_1/FINAL/eng".

requirement art 16 par 1 produces action communicate data to commission.

requirement art 16 par 1 produces action transmit data to parliament council.

requirement art 16 par 1 uses the definition def physical registration certificate.

requirement art 16 par 1 uses the definition def mobile registration certificate.

requirement art 16 par 1 uses the definition def vehicle.


