requirement art 10 par 1 obligation is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/vehicle-registration#Requirement_Art10_Par1_Obligation".

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation is a prescriptive rule.

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation has the label "Obligation to Accept Both Certificates for Vehicle Identification (Art. 10(1))".

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation has the legal text "After that date, Member States shall accept both physical and mobile registration certificates for that purpose.".

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation has the modality obligation.

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation has the requirement type "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/administrative-obligation/c_d98a69b9".

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation has the digital dimension digital public service.

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/96/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_179/art_10/par_1/FINAL/eng".

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation produces action ms accept both forms for id.

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation uses the definition def physical registration certificate.

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation uses the definition def mobile registration certificate.

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation uses the definition def vehicle.

requirement art 10 par 1 obligation has the comment "This obligation on Member States creates a correlative right for drivers/vehicle owners.".


