% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
scenario calendar is, as stated in the source description:
    % A case for the calendar: the events that a deadline counts from, and the rhythms that
    % count from nothing else, start on 2027-01-01.
    the calendar starts on 2027-01-01.
    "date of entry into force" happens on 2027-01-01.
    due_dates expects answers ["agent type member states has action communicate data to commission due on 2030-03-31", "agent type vehicle owner has action accept mobile cert due on 2031-01-01", "agent type vehicle owner has action require physical cert due on 2031-01-01"].
    due_in_2027 expects answers [].

scenario description is, as stated in the source description:
    modalities expects answers ["requirement art 10 par 1 obligation has the modality obligation", "requirement art 10 par 1 right has the modality right", "requirement art 10 par 2 has the modality obligation", "requirement art 10 par 3 has the modality obligation", "requirement art 16 par 1 has the modality obligation"].
    actions_of_rules expects answers ["requirement art 10 par 1 obligation produces action ms accept both forms for id", "requirement art 10 par 1 right produces action driver use format", "requirement art 10 par 2 produces action accept mobile cert", "requirement art 10 par 2 produces action require physical cert", "requirement art 10 par 3 produces action accept both certs", "requirement art 10 par 3 produces action verify formats", "requirement art 16 par 1 produces action communicate data to commission", "requirement art 16 par 1 produces action transmit data to parliament council"].
    actions_of_agents expects answers ["agent european commission acts as addressee in action communicate data to commission", "agent european commission acts as addresser in action transmit data to parliament council", "agent european council acts as addressee in action transmit data to parliament council", "agent european parliament acts as addressee in action transmit data to parliament council", "agent type competent authorities acts as addressee in action accept mobile cert", "agent type competent authorities acts as addressee in action require physical cert", "agent type member state of registration acts as addressee in action verify formats", "agent type member states acts as addressee in action driver use format", "agent type member states acts as addressee in action ms accept both forms for id", "agent type member states acts as addresser in action communicate data to commission", "agent type reregistering member state acts as addressee in action accept both certs", "agent type reregistering member state acts as addresser in action verify formats", "agent type vehicle owner acts as addresser in action accept mobile cert", "agent type vehicle owner acts as addresser in action require physical cert", "agent type vehicle owner acts as beneficiary in action driver use format", "agent type vehicle owner acts as beneficiary in action ms accept both forms for id"].

query obligations is:
    which rule has the modality obligation for which agent as which role.

query permissions is:
    which rule has the modality permission for which agent as which role.

query prohibitions is:
    which rule has the modality prohibition for which agent as which role.

query rights is:
    which rule has the modality right for which agent as which role.

query deadlines is:
    which thing has which temporal specification as deadline.

query due_dates is:
    which agent has which action due on which date.

query due_in_2027 is:
    which agent has which action due on which date in the period from 2027-01-01 to 2027-12-31.

query must_perform is:
    which party must perform which action by which date under which rule.

query must_perform_by_the_moment is:
    which party must perform which action by the moment which moment under which rule.

query met_in_time is:
    which party met which action in time under which rule.

query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query places is:
    which rule is laid down in which place.

query addressers is:
    which agent acts as addresser in which action.

query addressees is:
    which agent acts as addressee in which action.

query beneficiaries is:
    which agent acts as beneficiary in which action.

query triggers is:
    which thing is triggered by which event.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query rules_of_act is:
    which rule is established by the act which act.

query provisions is:
    which thing is established in which provision.

query legal_texts is:
    which thing has the legal text which text.

query joint_rules is:
    which rule is established in more than one provision.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query modalities is:
    which rule has the modality which modality.

query requirement_types is:
    which rule has the requirement type which requirement type.

query definitions is:
    which thing is a definition.

query definienda is:
    which definition has the definiendum which text.

query definientia is:
    which definition has the definiens which text.

query semantic_definitions is:
    which definition has the semantic flag which truth value.

query definitions_used is:
    which rule uses the definition which definition.

query actions_of_rules is:
    which rule produces which action.

query identified_agents is:
    which thing is an agent.

query agent_types is:
    which thing is an agent type.

query actions_of_agents is:
    which agent acts as which role in which action.

query concerned_agents is:
    which rule concerns which agent.

query sequence is:
    which action comes before which second action.

query starting_points is:
    which thing has which temporal specification as starting point.

query validity is:
    which thing has which temporal specification as validity.

query durations is:
    which temporal specification has the duration which duration.

query instants is:
    which temporal specification has the instant which date.

query frequencies is:
    which temporal specification has the frequency which duration.

query timed_after is:
    which temporal specification is timed after which second temporal specification.

query timed_immediately_after is:
    which temporal specification is timed immediately after which second temporal specification.

query first_dates is:
    the first date of which temporal specification is which date.

query last_dates is:
    the last date of which temporal specification is which date.

query later_times is:
    which temporal specification is later than which second temporal specification.

query times_within is:
    which temporal specification is during which second temporal specification.

query broken_links is:
    which temporal specification breaks its link with which second temporal specification.

query hours_as_days is:
    which temporal specification has a length of time that counts hours as whole days.

query obliged is:
    which party is obliged that which sentence.

query permitted is:
    which party is permitted that which sentence.

query forbidden is:
    which party is forbidden that which sentence.

query holders_of_rights is:
    which party has the right that which sentence.

query violations is:
    the obligation of which party that which sentence is violated.

query results is:
    which action has the result which result.

query composed_results is:
    which result is composed of which second result.

query digital_dimensions is:
    which rule has the digital dimension which dimension.

query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query other_values is:
    which thing has for which property the value which value.

query other_resources is:
    which thing has for which property the resource which resource.

query other_types is:
    which thing has the type which class.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

query literal_forms is:
    the values of which property have the datatype which datatype.

query definition_flags is:
    which definition has the semantic flag which truth value.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

